<title>UK: Randgold seen issuing 5 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Randgold seen issuing 5 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Randgold Resources Ltd issued five million shares in its London listing on Thursday instead of seven million as originally planned, market sources said.</p>
<p>No-one at HSBC James Capel, the share offer's co-ordinator, would comment.</p>
